  "speaker": "analyst Renee Odum",
  "text": "Hi Ms. Fairweather, this is Renee from Tidewater Federal Credit Union's fraud prevention team. We placed a hold on a $6,800 Zelle payment you started this morning. Can you tell me what it's for?"
 },
 {
  "source": "call transcript (verbatim)",
  "time": "2026-09-23 11:06 ET",
