  "text": "Release a held P2P payment only if ALL are true: (1) the member initiated the payment herself from her own device; (2) there is no sign that a third party is coaching the member or is present during the call; (3) the member can explain the purpose with specific, checkable details; (4) the payee's network-returned name is consistent with the person the member describes; (5) the member was not asked to keep the payment secret or to mislead the credit union. Otherwise keep the hold and escalate to a supervisor. The verbatim call transcript is the record of what the member said; analyst notes are summaries."
